      "id": "2120290974505058740",
      "text": "2030 is an eternity in the NBA, but… PG: TBD (Kas only 20 but feels like 3rd guard rather than starter) SG: Burries (LOCK IT BABY) SF: TBD PF: Ament (feel better about him now vs June, but long way to go) C: TBD (Ware seems more likely to be gone in a year than starting in 2030)",
