    {
      "id": "2120220072421581112",
      "text": "I’ve always been a Nance fan — would love to see him get a shot at some PF mins right now. Bucks’ execution in half court is generally really poor, so a guy who knows how to run DHOs, makes the right pass, and knocks down threes feels like an obvious positive. Can’t get worse…",
      "url": "https://x.com/fmaddenNBA/status/2120220072421581112",
      "published": "2026-11-10T18:20:31+00:00",
      "likes": 32,
      "author": "Frank Madden",
      "handle": "fmaddenNBA",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1484397622085533699/gkUrv5pP_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "@fmaddenNBA Best way to do this effectively is for Sims to get more minutes! He is the only big who sets screens (besides Nance, who is the g league)",
      "quoted_author": "LA Bucks",
      "quoted_handle": "WisDemGov2018"
    },
    {
      "id": "2120212928066371668",
      "text": "Would love to see more DHOs and solid screens to give Brayden runway to attack like this. He’s shooting 62% on twos (meaning he should shoot more) and has looked really comfortable pulling up or getting to rim since Vegas.",
      "url": "https://x.com/fmaddenNBA/status/2120212928066371668",
      "published": "2026-11-10T17:52:08+00:00",
      "likes": 18,
      "author": "Frank Madden",
      "handle": "fmaddenNBA",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1484397622085533699/gkUrv5pP_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Brayden Burries mid-range game was on point last night https://t.co/jjKMF7HNG6",
      "quoted_author": "All About the Bucks",
      "quoted_handle": "All_About_Bucks"
    },
