    {
      "id": "2119871553139511699",
      "text": "IMO Turner’s is worse b/c of the blast radius of the Dame stretch & symbolic value it had as the nail in the Giannis era’s coffin. BUT! GTJ is possibly the most transparently bad deal ever signed in NBA history…and we haven’t even gotten to a potential tampering penalty. Ope!",
      "url": "https://x.com/fmaddenNBA/status/2119871553139511699",
      "published": "2026-11-09T19:15:38+00:00",
      "likes": 40,
      "author": "Frank Madden",
      "handle": "fmaddenNBA",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1484397622085533699/gkUrv5pP_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "@fmaddenNBA Gary Trent Jr would like to enter the chat",
      "quoted_author": "Hamm_Slamwich",
      "quoted_handle": "mkehurtem"
    },
    {
      "id": "2119837647392964749",
      "text": "Turner is easily the Bucks’ worst ever FA signing given a) poor play relative to contract b) cost of stretching Dame to sign him c) difficulty Bucks will have moving him for neutral/+ value d) lack of fit with rebuild. Question now is if he can rehab value enough to get out.",
      "url": "https://x.com/fmaddenNBA/status/2119837647392964749",
      "published": "2026-11-09T17:00:54+00:00",
      "likes": 157,
      "author": "Frank Madden",
